# ===== Editor/IDE junk (if either of you uses VSCode too) =====
.vscode/

# ===== STM32 firmware lives in stm/ =====
# The CubeIDE project (.project, .cproject, STM32X.ioc, linker scripts) is
# tracked under stm/ and governed by stm/.gitignore. Keep those files tracked —
# teammates need them to reopen/reimport the project.